  "description": "Test build of Kalista as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Kalista so Martial Poise hops forward, back or sideways after each spear on her own (forward onto a low or fleeing enemy, back from one too close or charging, sideways while trading at range, to and fro in place on minions and monsters), she binds an Oathsworn at the start (a support first) whom Fate's Call pulls back to safety when he is low and threatened, or hurls beside the nearest enemy champion to engage when he is healthy and the fight is even, and Rend rips at once when it would kill. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
